# ENCflow の引用情報(Citation File Format 1.2.0)
# GitHub はこのファイルを認識し、リポジトリに「Cite this repository」を表示します。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  ENCflow を研究に使用した場合は、使用したソフトウェアの版(本ファイルの
  version。版ごとの DOI は Zenodo にあり、identifiers に当該版の DOI を
  記載しています)を引用してください。基礎となる ENC 格子・数値スキームの
  論文(references)も併せて引用してください。 / If you use ENCflow in
  your research, please cite the software version you used (the version
  of this file; each release has its own DOI on Zenodo, and identifiers
  lists the DOI of this version), together with the article on the
  underlying ENC grid and numerical scheme (references).
title: "ENCflow"
type: software
version: "3.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Tada"
    given-names: "Tsuyoshi"
    affiliation: "Department of Civil and Environmental Engineering, National Defense Academy, Japan"
  - family-names: "Kazama"
    given-names: "So"
    affiliation: "Department of Civil Engineering, Tohoku University, Japan"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22042847"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22042847"
    description: "Concept DOI (resolves to the latest release; covers all versions)"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23635011"
    description: "Version DOI of v3.0.0 (Zenodo archive of this release)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ENCflow/ENCflow"
# 基礎スキームの文献(ENCflow 全体のモデル記述論文は未刊行)
references:
  - type: article
    title: "An eight-neighborhood connected collocated grid scheme for overland flow simulation"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Tada"
        given-names: "Tsuyoshi"
        affiliation: "Department of Civil and Environmental Engineering, National Defense Academy, Japan"
    journal: "Hydrological Research Letters"
    volume: 20
    issue: 2
    start: 113
    end: 118
    year: 2026
    doi: "10.3178/hrl.25-00052"
    url: "https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/hrl/20/2/20_113/_article"
